<title>UK: Trinity H1 profits jump after Thomson buy.</title>
<headline>Trinity H1 profits jump after Thomson buy.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		11.4		   vs 11.7</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 3.6		    vs 3.3</p>
<p> Pretax		     23.8		   vs 13.3</p>
<p> Turnover		   165.3		  vs 82.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Newspaper group Trinity International Holdings Plc said the results include the Thomson businesses it acquired on January 8 this year.</p>
</text>
